== Contributions

- A formalisation of the "Build Systems à la Carte" framework in Lean 4, refined with dependent query types (`Val : Key -> Type`) and a separation of inputs from queries.
- An incremental elaborator for a dependently typed language supporting dependent function types, Tarski-style universes with universe polymorphism, inductive types with recursors, and structures with projections.
- An evaluation comparing incremental re-elaboration against batch elaboration and against Lean 4.
